sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as LazyGrid cell (Compose)
    participant Coil as Coil ImageLoader
    participant Mem as Memory cache
    participant Disk as Disk/OkHttp cache (Ch 12)
    participant CDN as CDN (Ch 57)

    UI->>Coil: AsyncImage(url?w=cellWidth, size=cell)
    Coil->>Mem: lookup key
    alt memory hit
        Mem-->>UI: decoded bitmap (instant)
    else miss
        Coil->>Disk: lookup
        alt disk hit
            Disk-->>Coil: encoded bytes -> decode off-main (downsample)
        else miss
            Coil->>CDN: fetch right-sized image
            CDN-->>Coil: bytes -> disk + decode
        end
        Coil-->>UI: crossfade in decoded bitmap
    end
    Note over UI,Coil: cell recycled -> request cancelled, no wrong image
